# Python FastAPI Standards

{{#if parameters.typeHints}}
- Add type hints to all function signatures and return types
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.asyncPreferred}}
- Use `async def` for I/O-bound endpoints
{{/if}}
- Define Pydantic models for request/response schemas
- Keep route handlers thin; delegate business logic to service layer
- Return structured error responses with `HTTPException` and consistent error codes
- Use dependency injection for database sessions and auth
- Place routers in `routers/`, services in `services/`, models in `models/`
